      "value": "<p>Founded in 1996, the UCAM Catholic University of Murcia aims at personal and professional success through the transmission of science, technology and culture. It is a private-funded university that maintains 10 faculties. Its approach integrates in-depth theoretical and practical knowledge.</p><p>With a focus on value-based education, the University offers 33 bachelor's, over 90 master's and 4 doctoral programs. Additionally, it also provides short online courses like big data fundamentals and application in bioinformatics, leadership and management in an international context, and fundamentals of 3D design and additive manufacturing.</p>",
