      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>The Spain Student Housing service makes it easy to find housing. You have the option of staying in university residences or at external units that have special agreements for UCAM students. You can also get a single room with a shared/private bathroom or a shared apartment.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Sports",
      "value": "<p>The UCAM Catholic University of Murcia and the Spanish Olympic Committee collaborated in 2012 for a sports and educational project allowing high-level athletes to combine their higher studies with training and competitions.</p><p>Notably, the University maintains clubs dedicated to various sports, such as table tennis, football, basketball, canoeing, taekwondo, water polo, judo, cycling, handball, karate, and swimming. It also has a popular Esports Club.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
